{"id":"3f502a94c920bde8","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-sw-solovay-ce.md","title":"c.e.特征实数上的sw与Solovay归约一致","display":"thm-sw-solovay-ce — c.e.特征实数上的sw与Solovay归约一致","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-sw-solovay-ce","aliases":["43-thm-sw-solovay-ce"],"display":"thm-sw-solovay-ce — c.e.特征实数上的sw与Solovay归约一致","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-sw-red]]","[[43-df-solovay-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Corollary 13.5.5, using Theorems 13.5.3–13.5.4","source_printed_pages":"353","source_pdf_pages":"373","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-sw-solovay-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-sw-solovay-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sw-solovay-ce — c.e.特征实数上的sw与Solovay归约一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8cae575293a2fb87\" href=\"?note=8cae575293a2fb87\" title=\"43-df-sw-red\">43-df-sw-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 13.5.5, using Theorems 13.5.3–13.5.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"353"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"373"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_A,\\alpha_B\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\alpha_A,\\alpha_B\\in[0,1]\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 的特征序列分别作sw的输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 的输入为所列实数；相关定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8cae575293a2fb87\" href=\"?note=8cae575293a2fb87\" title=\"43-df-sw-red\">43-df-sw-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_A\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in A}2^{-(n+1)},\\qquad\\alpha_B\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in B}2^{-(n+1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_A\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in A}2^{-(n+1)},\\qquad\\alpha_B\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in B}2^{-(n+1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_A\\le_S\\alpha_B\\iff\\chi_A\\le_{\\rm sw}\\chi_B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_A\\le_S\\alpha_B\\iff\\chi_A\\le_{\\rm sw}\\chi_B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显式区分c.e.集合的特征序列与其二进制特征实数，避免把一般左c.e.实数与c.e.位集混同。二进制展开非唯一仅在dyadic实数出现；此时相关位集可计算，两个归约方向均与最低度相容。核对来源的c.e.限制及两方向，未重证其同步近似构造。草稿Theorem13.5.3的一般左c.e./c.e.双向陈述与Theorem13.5.7冲突，且该处证明只给sw到S方向；本原子仅使用无此冲突的双方c.e.推论13.5.5。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Corollary 13.5.5, using Theorems 13.5.3–13.5.4；印刷页353，PDF页373。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sw-red","status":"resolved","id":"8cae575293a2fb87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sw-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)$；$\\alpha_A,\\alpha_B\\in[0,1]$ 由下式定义。$A,B$ 的特征序列分别作sw的输入，$\\le_S$ 的输入为所列实数；相关定义见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]、[[43-df-solovay-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sw-red","status":"resolved","id":"8cae575293a2fb87","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)$；$\\alpha_A,\\alpha_B\\in[0,1]$ 由下式定义。$A,B$ 的特征序列分别作sw的输入，$\\le_S$ 的输入为所列实数；相关定义见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]、[[43-df-solovay-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)$；$\\alpha_A,\\alpha_B\\in[0,1]$ 由下式定义。$A,B$ 的特征序列分别作sw的输入，$\\le_S$ 的输入为所列实数；相关定义见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]、[[43-df-solovay-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_A,\\alpha_B\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_A\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in A}2^{-(n+1)},\\qquad\\alpha_B\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in B}2^{-(n+1)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha_A\\le_S\\alpha_B\\iff\\chi_A\\le_{\\rm sw}\\chi_B.","display":true}],"bytes":1938,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-334","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-sw-solovay-ce]] — c.e.特征实数上的sw与Solovay归约一致"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","8cae575293a2fb87","a566c9610179ba40"]}